        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Timothy Zahn\n- Works: Vision of the Future, Hand of Thrawn novels, Thrawn trilogy, Heir to the Empire trilogy, Survivor's Quest, Quadrail\n- Topics: Star Wars novels, science fiction novels, fictional transport systems\n\nFacts:\n- Timothy Zahn wrote the best-selling science fiction novel series known as the Thrawn trilogy, which is also called the Heir to the Empire trilogy.\n- Vision of the Future is the second of the two Hand of Thrawn novels by Timothy Zahn, and those novels follow the Thrawn trilogy.\n- Timothy Zahn wrote the 1998 Star Wars novel Vision of the Future.\n- Survivor's Quest, written by Timothy Zahn, is a sequel to Vision of the Future.\n- Quadrail is a fictional intra-galactic rail system conceived by science fiction author Timothy Zahn.",
